</head><body>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/fraction_model.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>
<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 12 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">同分母FractionAddition</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">單元四 · 和 ≤ 1 的同分母Addition · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 分母加分母！分子加分子同時分母也相加 — 這是致命錯誤！<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>堂11（Fraction概念）<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 同分母FractionAddition ❷ 用圖形理解Addition ❸ 和 ≤ 1 ❹ Fraction應用<br/>
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維》3上A冊 單元六
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🍕 分數大作戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">通分、約分、四則混合！避開分母陷阱。連續答對分數翻倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？（想像：5 份中的 1 份 + 2 份 = ？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（4 份中的 1 份 + 2 份）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>下面邊個啱？A. <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> B. <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>一個蛋糕切 8 等份。小明吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，小華吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。兩人共吃了幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？如果和 = <span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，等於多少？（提示：<span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = 1 個整體！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min）</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：同分母Addition = 只加分子！<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 P3 最重要！</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>黃金法則：同分母Fraction相加 ——</strong><br/>
  ① <strong>分母不變</strong>（因為每份大小相同！）<br/>
  ② <strong>分子相加</strong>（只加攞咗幾多份）<br/>
  ③ 例如：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">1+2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span><br/>
  ④ <strong>記住：</strong>分母唔會加！分母只係話俾你知「每份有幾大」！
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：用圖形理解（Pizza法！）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="frac-diag">
<svg height="90" viewbox="0 0 230 90" width="230" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="5" y="20"></rect><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="27" y="66">1/4</text><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="50" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="95" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="140" y="20"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="97" y="82">+</text></svg>
<svg height="90" viewbox="0 0 230 90" width="230" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="5" y="20"></rect><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="27" y="66">1/4</text><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="50" y="20"></rect><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="72" y="66">1/4</text><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="95" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="140" y="20"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="97" y="82">=</text></svg>
<svg height="90" viewbox="0 0 230 90" width="230" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="5" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="50" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="95" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="140" y="20"></rect><text fill="#16A34A" font-size="14" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="97" y="82">3/4</text></svg>
</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">分子：1 + 2 = 3 | 分母不變：4<br/><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span></div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 2：Trap引爆！</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見災難</div><div class="eq"><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span></div><div class="why">連分母都加埋！1+1=2，3+3=6 → 完全錯！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確答案</div><div class="eq"><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span></div><div class="why">分母不變！只加分子：1+1=2，分母仍然是 3！</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命Trap（全港 P3 最高頻錯誤！）：同分母Fraction相加，<strong>分母不會相加</strong>！<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>，不是 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>判斷對錯：<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>。如果錯，寫出正確答案。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：和 = 1（等於一個整體）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
  ① 當分子 = 分母 → 等於 <strong>1 個整體</strong><br/>
  ② 例如：<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = 1、<span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = 1、<span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = 1<br/>
  ③ 和超過 1（如 <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>）係 P4 先學，P3 最多計到 = 1
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3</div><div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;"><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = <strong>1</strong>（一整個！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 4：三次Addition</div><div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">分子相加：1 + 2 + 3 = 6，分母不變：6<br/><span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = <strong>1</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（和 = 1？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> = ？（和 = ？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">11</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">11</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>小明吃了蛋糕的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>，妹妹吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>。共吃了幾分之幾？還剩幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>在 □ 填數字：<span class="f"><span class="n">□</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>=？三個Fraction連加！</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>=？和 = 1 嗎？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>紅色繩佔全長的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span>，藍色佔 <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span>。兩色共佔幾分之幾？還餘幾分之幾是綠色？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活Word Problems（共 5 題）<span class="star">🎯</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>🍕 一個 Pizza 切成 8 等份。爸爸吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，媽媽吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。他們共吃了幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>📏 一條絲帶，紅色部分佔 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>，藍色部分佔 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>。兩色共佔幾分之幾？黃色佔幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>🧩 一盒拼圖有 12 塊。小明砌了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span>，姐姐砌了 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span>。共砌了全盒的幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>🌺 花園的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 種玫瑰花，<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 種菊花。兩種花共佔花園的幾分之幾？草地佔幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>🍉 一個西瓜，上午吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，下午吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，晚上吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。全日共吃了幾分之幾？還剩幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）<span class="star">📝</span></div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)題（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>判斷 + 改正：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span> 正確嗎？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>=？（和 = 1？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>弟弟吃了蛋糕的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>，妹妹吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>。共吃了幾分之幾？還剩幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)題（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>花園的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 種玫瑰，<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 種菊花，<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 種鬱金香。種花部分共佔幾分之幾？餘下是草地，佔幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>一本故事書，第一天看了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，第二天看了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，比第三天少看 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。三天共看了幾分之幾？（先求第三天）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error</th><th>Correct Approach</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>分母也相加</strong>：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span></td><td>分母不變！只加分子：<span class="f"><span class="n">1+1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span></td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>忘記分子只加不乘</strong></td><td>同分母Addition = 分子相加，不是相乘</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>和 &gt; 1 時強行寫Fraction</strong></td><td>P3 階段和 ≤ 1；=1 時寫成 1</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>不會用圖形驗證</strong></td><td>畫條/Circle形，塗顏色驗證Addition結果</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>異分母當同分母加</strong></td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 唔可以直加！P4先學</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Word Problems忘記求「餘下」</strong></td><td>1 - 已用的Fraction = 餘下的Fraction</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>分子相加出錯</strong></td><td>小心：1+2+3 唔係 1x2x3！</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic一：「同分母相加好簡單，分母唔變企定定；分子相加寫上面，答案就係咁簡單。」</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic二：「分母係份數唔會變，分子係攞幾多份至會加；分母加分母係大錯，分子加分子先至啱。」</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">睇分母</div><div class="d">係咪相同？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">加分子</div><div class="d">分子相加</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">分母不變</div><div class="d">照寫原來分母</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">檢查</div><div class="d">和 ≤ 1？</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;">🌟 分母係個「單位名」，唔會因為加咗而變大！好似 2 個蘋果 + 3 個蘋果 = 5 個蘋果，單位「蘋果」唔會變！💪</div>
